Q1. Vehicle and Car Management
Medium
Create two classes: Vehicle and Car.
Parent class — Vehicle
- Private fields: brand, speed.
- Constructor to initialize both fields.
- Getters for both fields.
- Method start() that prints "Vehicle started".
Child class — Car extends Vehicle
- Add a private field fuelType.
- Initialize the parent fields using super().
- Create a displayCarDetails() method.
- Call the inherited start() method.
Test: Create a car with brand "Toyota", speed 120 and fuel type "Petrol".